      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Jejunal pseudodiverticulosis is an uncommon entity. Pseudodiverticulum are usually asymptomatic and an incidental finding. They can have a less frequent acute onset with perforation, obstruction or bleeding and they could have high morbidity and mortality. We report three patients who debuted with an acute abdomen."},
